    "offering_evidence": [
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Certain regions that we sell into or may sell into in the future may give priority to those products that are manufactured locally in their jurisdiction.",
        "start_character": 34910,
        "end_character": 35063
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, should we choose to manufacture locally in those jurisdictions, we would likely incur additional costs, may be unable to meet our quality system requirements or successfully manufacture products, and such activities will be a distraction from our current focus and operations.",
        "start_character": 35204,
        "end_character": 35493
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe the length of time required for products to be developed and to receive regulatory and, in some cases, reimbursement approval are also important competitive factors.",
        "start_character": 59851,
        "end_character": 60040
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we may pursue development projects for other plasma derived biological products, which may require the submission and approval of additional PMA supplements for the plasma system.",
        "start_character": 12488,
        "end_character": 12680
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we plan to continue spending on new product development and enhancements to our illumination device and next generation of our INTERCEPT Blood System kits, which may increase research and development expenses.",
        "start_character": 68892,
        "end_character": 69114
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In certain of these jurisdictions, we rely on these distributors to obtain any necessary in-country regulatory approvals, in addition to marketing and selling the INTERCEPT Blood System, providing customer and technical product support, maintaining inventories, and adhering to our quality system in all material respects, among other activities.",
        "start_character": 49823,
        "end_character": 50169
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to successfully commercialize all of our products and product candidates, we will be required to conduct significant research, development, preclinical and clinical evaluation, commercialization and regulatory compliance activities for our products and product candidates, which, together with selling, general and administrative expenses, may result in operating losses.",
        "start_character": 4533,
        "end_character": 4913
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a biomedical products company focused on developing and commercializing the INTERCEPT Blood System to enhance blood safety.",
        "start_character": 26,
        "end_character": 156
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also subject to other broadly applicable fraud and abuse and other healthcare laws and regulations, including anti-kickback, health care professional payment transparency, and health information privacy and security laws, which may constrain the business or financial arrangements and relationships through which we research, as well as, sell, market and distribute our products.",
        "start_character": 80008,
        "end_character": 80394
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently do not have alternate manufacturers for many of the components in our products or product candidates beyond those that we rely on, but we are in the process of identifying potential alternate manufacturers for several components, reagents and compounds.",
        "start_character": 28787,
        "end_character": 29053
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a small number of employees focused on servicing the markets in Asia-Pacific and Latin American regions and rely primarily on distributors to market and sell our products in those regions.",
        "start_character": 48475,
        "end_character": 48671
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085678",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085678-af11171fbf5cf033",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085678",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We strive to provide pay, benefits, and services that are competitive with local markets and create incentives to attract and retain employees across the globe.",
